**22.10.12**: \(P_{n}(\cos\,\theta){=}\frac{1}{\pi}\int_{{}_{0}}^{\pi}\left(\cos\,\theta{+}i\,\sin\, \theta\,\cos\,\phi\right)^{n}\!d\phi\)
**22.10.13**: \(P_{n}(\cos\,\theta){=}\frac{\sqrt{2}}{\pi}\int_{{}_{0}}^{\pi}\frac{\sin\,(n{+}{ \frac{1}{2}})\!\phi d\phi}{(\cos\,\theta{-}\!\cos\phi)^{n}}\)
**22.11. Rodrigues" Formula**

\(f_{n}(x){=}\frac{1}{a_{n}\rho(x)}\,\frac{d^{n}}{dx^{n}}(\rho(x)(g(z))^{n})\)

